𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 — Ea-nāṣir Copper Assessment (Tablet Mode)
𒑰 Thematic Inspiration: Historical Ea-nāṣir copper complaint tablet (UET V 72).
𒑰 Fictionalized computational example for demonstrating the Tablet Archive.

